OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will chair a meeting of
OL,8,Fthe Government's emergency Cobra
OL,9,Fcommittee on Wednesday in response to
OL,10,Fextreme heat, which has caused
OL,11,Fwidespread wildfires and plunged many
OL,12,Fparts of the country into drought.
OL,14,FThe Prime Minister will meet with
OL,15,Fministers, officials and agencies as
OL,16,Fhigh temperatures continue across the
OL,17,FUK on Wednesday afternoon, with
OL,18,Ftemperatures of 33C forecast, and up
OL,19,Fto 38C on Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FMinisters from the Department for
OL,8,FEnvironment, Food and Rural Affairs
OL,9,F(Defra), Home Office, and Department
OL,10,Ffor Health will attend. The
OL,11,FEnvironment Agency will also be
OL,12,Fpresent.
OL,14,FIt will be the second Cobra meeting
OL,15,Fthis year on heatwaves, after one took
OL,16,Fplace amid high temperatures in June.
OL,18,FA Downing Street spokesperson said the
OL,19,FGovernment understood firefighters,
OL,20,Ffarmers and NHS staff were all facing
OL,21,Fchallenges connected to the weather.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FOn Tuesday a firefighter union chief
OL,8,Fwarned the country faces a "national
OL,9,Femergency" amid ongoing wildfires.
OL,11,FThe Met Office said the UK is on
OL,12,Fcourse for its hottest summer on
OL,13,Frecord, as parts of the country face
OL,14,Ftheir fifth heatwave this summer.
OL,16,FRare amber "extreme heat" warnings
OL,17,Fhave been issued by the forecaster for
OL,18,FLondon and parts of the South East,
OL,19,FEast Midlands, East of England, West
OL,20,FMidlands and South Yorkshire from 9am
OL,21,Fto midnight on Thursday.
OL,26,@pD@\OUqD@JO]xD@LOUxD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FThe Government urged the public to pay
OL,8,Fattention to UK Health Security Agency
OL,9,Fheat health alerts, and advised people
OL,10,Fshould drink plenty of fluids and
OL,11,Fcheck in on family, friends and
OL,12,Fneighbours who may be at high risk.
OL,14,FA No 10 spokesperson said: "The Prime
OL,15,FMinister will chair a meeting of COBR
OL,16,F` the government emergency committee `
OL,17,Fthis afternoon on the UK's ongoing
OL,18,Fresponse to extreme heat, wildfires
OL,19,Fand drought.
OL,26,@vD@\OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,F"We know how challenging this summer
OL,8,Fis proving, particularly for
OL,9,Ffirefighters tackling wildfires,
OL,10,Ffarmers working in drought conditions,
OL,11,Fand NHS staff in busy A&E units.
OL,13,F"We will continue to take the action
OL,14,Fneeded to keep communities safe,
OL,15,Fprotect water supplies and safeguard
OL,16,Fthe environment."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
