PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FMet Office chief forecaster Chris
OL,8,FBulmer said: "While the peak heat will
OL,9,Fbe more short-lived than recent
OL,10,Fheatwaves, temperatures widely into
OL,11,Fthe mid-30s Celsius on Thursday brings
OL,12,Fthe potential for impacts for some,
OL,13,Fwhich is why a Met Office warning has
OL,14,Fbeen issued.
OL,26,@pD@NOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
