SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,F"High pressure is now becoming
OL,8,Fdominant and temperatures will build
OL,9,Fday by day. Southerly and south-
OL,10,Feasterly winds will also tap into the
OL,11,Fhot conditions over Europe which helps
OL,12,Fdevelop this further notable heat in
OL,13,Fwhat has been a hot and dry summer so
OL,14,Ffar for many in the south of the UK."
OL,16,FIt comes as Steve Wright, general
OL,17,Fsecretary of the Fire Brigades Union
OL,18,F(FBU), warned the UK faces a national
OL,19,Femergency "right now" with fires
OL,20,Facross the country.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@eO]{D@KOU{D@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
