OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FFirefighters have responded to 966
OL,8,Fwildfires across England and Wales
OL,9,Fthis year, including 185 in the first
OL,10,F10 days of August alone, while July
OL,11,Fwas the busiest month on record for
OL,12,Fwildfires with 458 incidents, the
OL,13,FNational Fire Chiefs Council (NFCC)
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FCrews from Hampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,17,FFire and Rescue Service have battled a
OL,18,Ffire in the New Forest, which started
OL,19,Fafter a van caught fire on the A31
OL,20,Fnear Ringwood on Sunday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FThe area hit by the blaze is protected
OL,8,Fheathland and home to a number of rare
OL,9,Fspecies, according to the New Forest
OL,10,FNational Park Authority.
OL,12,FMr Wright told Times Radio: "In many
OL,13,Fparts of the country, firefighters do
OL,14,Fnot have the new modern equipment to
OL,15,Fdeal with these.
OL,26,@tD@]OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,F"They do not have the new modern
OL,8,Fpersonal protective equipment, the
OL,9,Flightweight fire kit that we wear, the
OL,10,Fright helmets, lightweight helmets,
OL,11,Fbreathable uniforms to make sure
OL,12,Fthey're better protected, their health
OL,13,Fis protected when they're out dealing
OL,14,Fwith these incidents for hours and
OL,15,Fhours on end."
OL,17,FThe Government said it had announced
OL,18,F#97 million in new funding to upgrade
OL,19,Fnational firefighting capabilities,
OL,20,Fincluding off-road vehicles and
OL,21,Fspecialist equipment.
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
