OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FNearly three quarters of England and
OL,8,Fthe whole of Wales are in drought,
OL,9,Fafter a record dry July and very dry
OL,10,Fstart to August has combined with high
OL,11,Ftemperatures to put pressure on water
OL,12,Fresources.
OL,14,FSouthern Water has applied for a rare
OL,15,Fnon-domestic drought order which would
OL,16,Fban businesses from non-essential
OL,17,Fwater use, including cleaning cars and
OL,18,Ffilling swimming pools, saying an
OL,19,F"exceptional" lack of rain has
OL,20,Fthreatened supplies in Hampshire and
OL,21,Fthe Isle of Wight.
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
