OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FIt warned that 165,000 people in the
OL,8,FSouthampton West supply area could
OL,9,Fface restricted supplies.
OL,11,FEnvironment Secretary Angela Eagle
OL,12,Fwill decide on the application, which
OL,13,Fwould be the first such ban since May
OL,14,F2006.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FRecord-breaking heatwaves in May and
OL,8,FJune led to the deaths of more than
OL,9,F2,800 people, while parts of the
OL,10,Fcountry were hit with further
OL,11,Fheatwaves last month as England and
OL,12,FWales endured their driest July since
OL,13,Frecords began in 1836.
OL,15,FThe Environment Agency said 71.3% of
OL,16,FEngland is now experiencing "flash
OL,17,Fdrought", as a dry start to August
OL,18,Ffollowed the country's driest July on
OL,19,Frecord.
OL,26,@xD@]OUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786569550
OL,3,CPM to chair emergency Cobra meeting
OL,4,Camid 'extreme heat' warning and
OL,5,Cwildfires
OL,7,FFlash drought is one which develops
OL,8,Fvery quickly because of a combination
OL,9,Fof very low rainfall and high
OL,10,Ftemperatures.
OL,12,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper said:
OL,13,F"I want to thank NHS staff who are
OL,14,Fonce again stepping up to cope with
OL,15,Fthe extra pressures that hot weather
OL,16,Fbrings.
OL,18,F"Extreme heat can be dangerous, so
OL,19,Fstaying aware of warnings and alerts
OL,20,Fin place can make a real difference."
OL,26,@uD@AOUzD@AOU|D@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
